<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Search Failed</title>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    *{ box-sizing:border-box; }

    body{
      margin:0;
      min-height:100vh;
      overflow:hidden;
      font-family:'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top right,#ead5ff 0%,transparent 28%),
      radial-gradient(circle at bottom left,#d9efff 0%,transparent 28%),
      #fffaff;
    }

    .page{
      min-height:100vh;
      position:relative;
      padding:35px 45px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .top-logo{
      position:absolute;
      top:28px;
      left:40px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:16px;
    }

    .logo-title{
      margin:0;
      line-height:.9;
      letter-spacing:-1px;
    }

    .gradient-text{
      display:block;
      font-size:34px;
      font-weight:900;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0f8fff 0%,#1d7cff 35%,#6c63ff 68%,#b44cf0 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip:text;
      background-clip:text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
      color:transparent;
    }

    .atom-logo{
      position:relative;
      width:72px;
      height:72px;
    }

    .orbit{
      position:absolute;
      top:50%;
      left:50%;
      width:64px;
      height:24px;
      border:3px solid;
      border-radius:50%;
      transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    }

    .orbit1{
      border-color:#1695e8;
      transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(0deg);
    }

    .orbit2{
      border-color:#8c39e8;
      transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(60deg);
    }

    .orbit3{
      border-color:#1db2ea;
      transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-60deg);
    }

    .electron{
      position:absolute;
      width:10px;
      height:10px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a8fe8,#9b31e7);
      box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(147,51,234,.8);
    }

    .electron1{
      top:-5px;
      left:56%;
    }

    .electron2{
      bottom:-4px;
      right:18%;
    }

    .center-wrap{
      text-align:center;
    }

    .main-title{
      margin:0;
      font-size:110px;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:5px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,#12a8ff 0%,#388fff 25%,#8660ff 58%,#c04dff 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip:text;
      background-clip:text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
      color:transparent;
      filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(120,120,255,.18));
    }

    .sub-title{
      margin:8px 0 55px;
      font-size:50px;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:6px;
      color:#b44cf0;
      text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(180,76,240,.25);
    }

    .message-box{
      margin-bottom:55px;
    }

    .message-title{
      font-size:32px;
      line-height:1.8;
    }

    .blue{ color:#58abf5; }
    .purple{ color:#b44cf0; }

    .line{
      width:480px;
      max-width:90%;
      height:4px;
      margin:28px auto;
      background:#ead0ff;
      border-radius:999px;
    }

    .desc{
      margin:0;
      font-size:20px;
      line-height:2;
      color:#494468;
    }

    .button-wrap{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:24px;
    }

    .action-btn{
      width:300px;
      height:74px;
      border:none;
      border-radius:30px;
      background:white;
      border:4px solid #c35cff;
      color:#58abf5;
      font-size:20px;
      font-weight:900;
      font-family:'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      cursor:pointer;
      box-shadow:8px 8px 0 rgba(195,92,255,.18);
      transition:.2s;
    }

    .action-btn:hover{
      transform:translateY(-4px);
    }

    .arrow{
      color:#b44cf0;
      margin-right:12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="page">

    <div class="top-logo">
      <h1 class="logo-title">
        <span class="gradient-text">Chemicom</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="atom-logo">
        <div class="orbit orbit1">
          <div class="electron electron1"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="orbit orbit2">
          <div class="electron electron2"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="orbit orbit3"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="center-wrap">
      <h2 class="main-title">NO RESULT</h2>

      <h3 class="sub-title">SEARCH FAILED</h3>

      <div class="message-box">
        <div class="message-title">
          <span class="blue">검색 결과를</span>
          <span class="purple">찾을 수 없습니다.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="line"></div>

        <p class="desc">
          화학 물질 이름 또는 화학식을<br>
          다시 확인한 후 검색해주세요.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="button-wrap">
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="history.back()">
          <span class="arrow">↩</span>
          이전으로 돌아가기
        </button>

        <button class="action-btn" onclick="location.href='index.html'">
          <span class="arrow">⌂</span>
          홈으로 돌아가기
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
